{"redo_desc_about":"An Introduction to the World of Stand Up Paddle Boarding.
Learn the basics of this super fun sport. Get familiar with the gear youll be using, learn about safety & getting on & off your board. Get to grips with Board & paddle control and different paddle strokes and have great fun while youre doing it.

